Extension 5: Live Server

================================================================================

Creator listed in lesson: Ritwick Dey

Purpose

Live Server can serve ordinary HTML-based content locally and refresh the browser as files change.

Basic Usage
Step | Action
-----|---------------------------------------------
1    | Install Live Server
2    | Open an HTML file
3    | Select "Open with Live Server"
4    | Browser opens the page
5    | Saved changes can trigger browser refresh

Example HTML
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <title>My App</title>
</head>

<body>
  <h1>Hello World</h1>
</body>
</html>

Benefits
Reduces manual browser refreshes.
Gives fast feedback for HTML/CSS/JavaScript changes.
Useful for static web projects.

React note: A typical React project normally uses its own development server/tooling, so Live Server is more directly useful for plain HTML/CSS/JavaScript projects.

