Extension 6: Bracket Pair Colorizer

================================================================================

Purpose in the Lesson

Bracket Pair Colorizer colors matching brackets to make nested code easier to understand.

Example:

function myFunction() {
  if (condition) {
    return [1, 2, 3];
  }
}


The goal is to visually distinguish matching:

()
{}
[]

Benefits
Makes nested code easier to read.
Helps identify matching bracket pairs.
Makes code structure clearer.

Current-use note: VS Code itself includes bracket-pair colorization capabilities, so a separate Bracket Pair Colorizer extension may not be required.

