Extension 7: Path Intellisense

================================================================================

Creator listed in lesson: Christian Kohler

Purpose

Path Intellisense helps auto-complete file paths.

It can help with:

File-name suggestions.
Import paths.
Reducing path typos.
Faster navigation.
Example

Start typing:

import Component from './comp';


Possible suggestions:

./components/MyComponent.js
./components/Button.js
./components/Header.js


Then choose the required path.

Benefits
Benefit              | Description
---------------------|--------------------------------
Path Completion      | Suggests file paths
Import Accuracy      | Reduces path typing errors
Navigation           | Helps locate project files
Productivity         | Reduces manual typing


