Extension 8: GitLens

================================================================================

Creator listed in lesson: Eric Amodio

Purpose

GitLens enhances Git-related information and workflows inside VS Code.

Examples of useful information include:

Code history.
Changes.
Commit information.
Authorship information.

Example concept:

const [count, setCount] = useState(0);

History:
Author  → John Doe
Time    → 2 days ago
Commit  → Corresponding Git commit

Benefits
Benefit             | Description
--------------------|------------------------------------
History             | Understand previous code changes
Authorship          | Identify who changed a line
Commits             | Inspect related commit information
Collaboration       | Provides additional repository context


