DISABLE AN EXTENSION

================================================================================

Step | Action
-----|-----------------------------------------
1    | Open Extensions
2    | Locate the extension
3    | Open its management options
4    | Select Disable
5    | Extension remains installed but inactive

When to Disable
Extension conflicts with another extension.
Extension affects VS Code performance.
Extension isn't needed for the current project.
You are troubleshooting/testing.

================================================================================

