PART 8: TROUBLESHOOTING EXTENSIONS

================================================================================

Issue 1: Extension Installed but Not Working
Solution                | Steps
------------------------|-------------------------------------------
Reload VS Code          | Command Palette → Reload Window
Disable/Re-enable       | Disable extension → Enable again
Reinstall               | Uninstall → restart VS Code → reinstall


================================================================================

Issue 2: VS Code Running Slowly

================================================================================

Possible cause:

Too many active extensions or a problematic extension


Possible troubleshooting:

Step | Action
-----|-------------------------------------
1    | Disable extensions you don't need
2    | Remove unnecessary extensions
3    | Review extension settings
4    | Restart/reload VS Code


================================================================================

Issue 3: Extension Conflicts

================================================================================

Step | Action
-----|------------------------------------------
1    | Disable one potentially conflicting extension
2    | Test again
3    | Identify which extension causes the problem
4    | Keep the extension you need
5    | Find an alternative if required


